{"message":"Net change in unrecognized tax benefits from the end of fiscal 2007 to the end of fiscal 2008 equals the fiscal 2008 ending balance minus the fiscal 2007 ending balance. The 2007 ending balance is the 2008 beginning balance of $126.6 million (source t1c1n0), and the 2008 ending balance is $214.4 million (source t8c1n0). Both amounts are in $ millions.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"214.4 - 126.6","variables":{"ending_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"USD_million"},"ending_2007":{"value":126.6,"source":"source:t1c1n0","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"ending_2008":"source:t8c1n0","ending_2007":"source:t1c1n0"}}}